# ==============================================================
# vAPI Network - Private Keys List (1 baris per wallet)
# ==============================================================
# Anda dapat memasukkan Private Key (0x...) atau 12/24 Mnemonic Seed Phrase.
# File ini diabaikan oleh .gitignore agar data Anda tetap aman.
#
# Contoh format Private Key:
# 0x0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef
#
# Contoh format Seed Phrase:
# apple banana cherry date elderberry fig grape honeydew kiwi lemon mango nectarine
